{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "956c2d1e-d8d4-8489-b398-9b7dea24b072",
  "created_at": "2026-02-17T11:57:36-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Vincent Lombardozzi",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:53:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:53:30-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. Good morning. I am calling about a fence. Can you hear me okay? My signal is not good here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:53:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A little choppy, but I've got you. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:53:46-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I manage a property at forty-one Bellevue Avenue. The old fence is rotted, it is falling down in pieces. I am replacing it with a new one, in the same spot, same line."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:54:03-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What are you putting up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:54:07-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Black aluminum. Six feet tall. The guy can start next week, so I need to know, do I need to pull a permit before the guy starts?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:54:20-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Generally, yes, a fence needs a permit here, even when you're replacing one. Six feet is on the taller side, so they'll want to look at it. Same location helps, but you'd still apply first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:54:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Even same spot. [line breaks up] I thought replacing is only repair. It is the same fence."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:54:46-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you, but you're taking down the old one and putting up a new one at a new height maybe. Was the old one six feet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:54:59-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think five. Maybe five. It is rotted so, hard to say."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:55:06-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Then that's another reason to file. Just don't let the contractor start until you have it in hand."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:55:15-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is there an application online? I tried the city app yesterday and it locked me out. I had to answer security questions, my first pet, my first street, all this. Twenty minutes. Then it still did not work."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:55:34-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I've heard that from a few people. You can also come in and fill out the paper form at the counter, or I can have one sent to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:55:49-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I would rather come in. Online, no more. What do I bring?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:55:56-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Address, a sketch or survey showing where the fence goes, and the type and height. Owner's name too, since you're the manager."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:56:07-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A sketch, I can do. Hand drawn is okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:56:12-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hand drawn is fine if it's clear. Show the property lines and where the fence runs."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:56:20-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Another question. The finished side, the nice side, must it face out? Toward the street and the neighbor?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:56:30-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's usually the expectation, the good side faces out. But with aluminum, a lot of them look the same both sides. Confirm it on the application and they'll tell you if there's an issue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:56:47-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay. [crosstalk] Sorry, you said confirm it on the application?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:56:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. It'll be on the form, or the reviewer will ask."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:56:59-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. So, today I lose the whole day for this. I told the contractor next week, now maybe not."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:57:09-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't promise a turnaround, but if you bring the sketch in and it's complete, that's the quickest way. Counter's open until four-thirty today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:57:21-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can come after lunch. Good. Thank you for your help, Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:57:27-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Have a good one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T11:57:31-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. God bless you and your family."
    }
  ],
